NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-26 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:06.670
Willa used to rely on me for everything. Now they're turning her against me.

2
00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:10.610
Alara will never get custody. The second the waiting period is over, file the suit.

3
00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.610
Understood, Mr. Sterling.

4
00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:17.610
Mr. Sterling, maybe you should just tell Alara the truth.

5
00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.410
If she knew who you really are, she'd never treat you like this.

6
00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.410
If she cared at all, she would have noticed.

7
00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:26.910
I ran the entire group from that house, yet she never once asked what I did all day.

8
00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:30.410
For seven years, I was a joke.

9
00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:34.410
You're not a joke. They just never cared enough to see it.

10
00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:43.580
You've done more than enough. You deserve better.

11
00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.580
New watch, courtesy of Alara.

12
00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:48.580
She's even bidding on the biggest piece at the auction tonight for me.

13
00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.080
Now this is living.

14
00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:54.080
That's my girl. Finally found a real man who deserves the Wittek name.

15
00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:58.580
A 20 grand watch. An auction piece worth hundreds of thousands.

16
00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:01.580
And what did I get for seven years of taking care of them?

17
00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:06.080
Absolutely nothing. To them, I'm worth less than the damn watch on his wrist.

18
00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:10.080
Mr. Sterling, this is the live feed from the ballroom. You should see this.

19
00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:22.140
Where's Cal? Haven't seen him all night.

20
00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:25.140
Yeah, you're all here. Where's Cal?

21
00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.140
Who is he? And why is he standing so close to you?
